%%{init: {"theme": "neutral"} }%%
sequenceDiagram
    title Identify one product in stock
    autonumber
    actor M as Merchant
    participant P as mobile
    participant A as Tally apps/api
    participant S as Meta Model API
    participant Q as Qore Catalog

    Note over M,Q: BUILT: tiers 0 and 1. PLANNED: tier 2, an on-device model.
    M->>P: point camera at one item
    alt barcode read (tier 0)
        P->>P: look up cached inventory → item
    else no barcode after ~600 ms, frame steady (tier 1)
        P->>P: scale to 640 px, JPEG ~80 KB
        P->>A: POST /api/businesses/:id/vision/identify [multipart, Bearer JWT]
        A->>S: muse-spark-1.3, minimal reasoning: read the label {brand, name, pack}
        S-->>A: reading (~1.3–3 s)
        A->>A: match the merchant's items: remembered reading, then brand + name
        opt nothing in store matched
            A->>Q: POST /v1/match (x-api-key)
            Q-->>A: candidates → a stocked Qore ID, or suggestions to add
        end
        A-->>P: match (needsConfirm, archived) or null + candidates
    end
    P-->>M: suggestion
    M->>P: tap to confirm the item (or pick the right one)
    P->>A: POST …/vision/identify/confirm {reading, itemId}
    A->>A: remember the reading → next time it matches at once
